# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0102.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Client -> Virtual Gateway: mTLS
Virtual Gateway -> Virtual Router
Virtual Router -> Backend Node: Weighted Routing
Virtual Router -> Canary Node: Weighted Routing
Backend Node -> DB Proxy Node: Circuit Breaker
Canary Node -> DB Proxy Node: Circuit Breaker
Frontend Node -> Virtual Router
DB Proxy Node -> Database: Connection Pool
Backend Node -> X-Ray: Traces
Canary Node -> X-Ray: Traces

App Mesh { Backend Services, Virtual Gateway, Virtual Router, Virtual Service, Frontend Node, DB Proxy Node }
Backend Services { Backend Node, Canary Node }
